    "resolved_on": "2026-11-04",
    "resolution": "docker buildx imagetools inspect --raw for the index and platform manifests, docker buildx imagetools inspect --format '{{json .Image}}' for created times, Docker Hub tag API for the tag digest and last_updated. Oracle XE tags are single amd64 manifests, so manifest_digest is the pin and index_digest is null.",
    "age_gate": "MySQL and PostgreSQL use the exact T1/T8 acceptance patches designated by coordinator H-S2-pins, not latest-patch selection. Oracle pins retain their existing selection. Legacy SP00 pins are excluded from v0.2 resolution.",
    "run_policy": "tools/oo-test runs ref@platform_digest from images.pins with an explicit --platform; Docker server native architecture when available, else linux/amd64 under emulation. Oracle Free is deliberately pinned to 23.5 for 23ai coverage rather than the newer 26ai line."
